{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "MoonClerk API",
    "version": "1",
    "summary": "Read-only REST API over MoonClerk payment forms, customers, and payments.",
    "description": "A **read-only** REST-style API. Every operation is a `GET`; forms, plans, and pricing are configured in the MoonClerk interface, not over the API.\n\n## Authentication\n\nPass your API key in the `Authorization` header as an authorization token:\n\n```\nAuthorization: Token token=YOUR_API_KEY\n```\n\nThis is **not** a Bearer token. Generate a key at <https://app.moonclerk.com/settings/api-key>. Anyone holding the key can read your account data, so keep it private.\n\n## Versioning\n\nThe API version travels in the `Accept` header, which is **required**:\n\n```\nAccept: application/vnd.moonclerk+json;version=1\n```\n\nThat media type is the response content type for every operation below. JSON is the only supported format.\n\n## A complete request\n\n```shell\ncurl https://api.moonclerk.com/forms \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Token token=YOUR_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"Accept: application/vnd.moonclerk+json;version=1\"\n```\n\n## Paging\n\nList operations return 10 rows by default. Use `count` (1–100) and `offset`.\n\n## Field conventions\n\n- Dates are ISO 8601 in UTC.\n- Money fields are integers denominated in **cents**, alongside a `currency` field.\n- Any key ending in `_reference` is the corresponding Stripe ID.\n\n## Throttling\n\nExceeding the rate limit returns `429 Too Many Requests`. Reduce the number and frequency of calls and retry later. No `RateLimit` response headers are currently published.\n\n## Errors\n\nError responses are currently `text/plain`, not JSON.",
    "termsOfService": "https://www.moonclerk.com/terms-of-service/",
    "license": {
      "name": "MoonClerk Terms of Service",
      "url": "https://www.moonclerk.com/terms-of-service/"
    },
    "contact": {
      "name": "MoonClerk support",
      "email": "support@moonclerk.com",
      "url": "https://www.moonclerk.com/developers/"
    },
    "x-provenance": {
      "transcribed-from": "https://github.com/moonclerk/developer (branch: main) — api/README.md, api/v1/customers.md, api/v1/forms.md, api/v1/payments.md",
      "transcribed-on": "2026-08-22",
      "warning": "Do NOT restate the auth scheme as a Bearer token, and do NOT add a /v2/ path segment or an 'events' endpoint. The interactive demo on /features shows 'curl https://api.moonclerk.com/v2/events -H \"Authorization: Bearer $MOONCLERK_KEY\"', which is wrong on all three counts. The live API's own 401 body, 'HTTP Token: Access denied.', is Rails' HTTP Token authentication and corroborates the 'Token token=' scheme.",
      "note": "Hand-transcribed from the published docs, not generated from the server. If the API changes, this file does not update itself."
    },
    "x-jentic-source-url": "https://www.moonclerk.com/openapi.json"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.moonclerk.com",
      "description": "Production. HTTPS only; there is no version path segment."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/forms": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "listForms",
        "summary": "List payment forms",
        "description": "Returns every payment form on the account, newest first. Supports `count` and `offset` paging.",
        "tags": [
          "Forms"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/count"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/offset"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "A page of forms.",
            "content": {
              "application/vnd.moonclerk+json;version=1": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "forms"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "forms": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Form"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          },
          "502": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          },
          "504": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/forms/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "getForm",
        "summary": "Get a payment form",
        "description": "Returns one payment form by its MoonClerk ID.",
        "tags": [
          "Forms"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/id"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The requested form.",
            "content": {
              "application/vnd.moonclerk+json;version=1": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "form"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "form": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Form"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          },
          "502": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          },
          "504": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/customers": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "listCustomers",
        "summary": "List customers",
        "description": "Returns customers and their subscription info. These are the records the MoonClerk web interface calls \"Plans\". Filters may be combined; all date filters are `YYYY-MM-DD` and UTC-based, with `*_from` starting at the beginning of the day and `*_to` running through the end of it.",
        "tags": [
          "Customers"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/count"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/offset"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/formId"
          },
          {
            "name": "checkout_from",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Customers created on or after this date.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "checkout_to",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Customers created on or before this date.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "next_payment_from",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Subscription due to bill on or after this date.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "next_payment_to",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Subscription due to bill on or before this date.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "status",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Subscription status.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "active",
                "canceled",
                "expired",
                "past_due",
                "pending",
                "unpaid"
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "A page of customers.",
            "content": {
              "application/vnd.moonclerk+json;version=1": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "customers"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "customers": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Customer"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          },
          "502": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          },
          "504": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/ServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
